oth for stamina overall and for more efficiency and energy during periods that require quick bursts, such as hill climbs, surges, and finishing sprints.</p><br><p>Improved ATP regeneration through boosted phosphocreatine stores allows runners to sustain higher intensities for longer. </p><br><p>Studies have also shown that creatine can help muscles store more glycogen, which is the primary fuel for endurance running. Finally, creatine is associated with better water retention in muscles, improving cellular hydration.</p><br><p>So, in brief - you get more energy, you sustain higher intensity, you sprint better and more efficiently, and you stay more hydrated. What else can you ask for?</p></span></div></div><picture data-rid="3281b0f3-288c-498d-8d8c-9cffebabd764" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0" class="r-zuco4u"><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0611/9204/4732/files/Infographic_CreatineBenefitsMap_WhiteBG_4_a5c5a9b8-b35f-46cb-b5b0-deaa2674153a.webp?v=1738701096&amp;width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0611/9204/4732/files/Infographic_CreatineBenefitsMap_WhiteBG_4_a5c5a9b8-b35f-46cb-b5b0-deaa2674153a.webp?v=1738701096&amp;width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0611/9204/4732/files/Infographic_CreatineBenefitsMap_WhiteBG_4_a5c5a9b8-b35f-46cb-b5b0-deaa2674153a.webp?v=1738701096&amp;width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0611/9204/4732/files/Infographic_CreatineBenefitsMap_WhiteBG_4_a5c5a9b8-b35f-46cb-b5b0-deaa2674153a.webp?v=1738701096" alt="Circular diagram showing eight benefits of creatine, including increased energy and muscle growth." class="r-3o8dzq" loading="eager"/></picture></div><div data-rid="7a3d1a3a-6883-4eae-a366-3438c1342b11" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0" class="r-ct3syk"><div data-rid="69de6dc7-3de2-4dfb-be2b-16ab1a5e6fc1" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0" class="r-kk3uyh"><div data-rid="6fcfb42f-c3d0-4318-b0a1-7a9447e8bef6" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0" class="r-eum3kp"><div data-rid="f6e82f6a-16b0-4a1a-af15-b1a103261d9a" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-sw73a5"><div class="r-83dvbg"><video src="https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/o/v/a31db0988e70462db3c5f26056044278.mp4" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:var(--rof, inherit);object-position:var(--rop, inherit)" preload="metadata" autoplay="" muted="" loop=""></video></div></div></div><div data-rid="22568c8a-b295-4dfc-86b5-524d47655704" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0" class="r-z2d8v9"><div data-rid="404d6983-dafc-4f08-be15-a23642f5413e" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-sgbdzp alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>2. Improves focus during long training sessions and races</p></span></div><div data-rid="86a97f58-24aa-4e78-8b42-f6691c96a678" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-v8g11m alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Creatine has been linked to improved brain function and reduced mental fatigue. This not only improves the efficacy of your workouts, but also allows you to stay focused and push through exhaustion during races.</p><br><p>Increased ATP production also isn't just present for muscular usage - additional ATP production also provides the brain with more energy, improving reaction time, concentration, and decision-making during races. </p><br><p>Beyond the clear muscular benefits, studies have shown that creatine has neuroprotective properties, which can reduce the stress and anxiety from increased cortisol levels present with endurance training.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="cbd5bb4e-ac96-48a7-99c9-b657c36afb92" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0" data-alchemy-url-hashmark="influencers" tabindex="-1" id="influencers" data-alchemy-url-hashmark-ignore="true" class="r-5qjte"><div data-rid="4c197acc-4113-4a97-8bb5-477087ecb5fc" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0" class="r-3nmy5v"><div data-rid="e9731ebb-2b35-46de-b69b-c55023ee9120" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0" class="r-1crhug4 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>3. Improved recovery after workouts</p></span></div><div data-rid="dc3945b4-96cc-4ed0-92a6-cb8c42bf8323" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0" class="r-wvrm59 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>All endurance athletes have had at least that one workout where they feel like they can't get out of the bed the next day, let alone hit a long run or warm-up strides. Long-distance endurance sports like running result in muscle damage and inflammation over time.</p><br><p>Creatine has been shown to reduce muscle soreness and to speed up recovery, allowing you to train more frequently and just feel better the next day.</p></span></div></div><picture data-rid="e07c450e-e0cc-40cc-9666-906247d24dbd" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0" class="r-dmqpiq"><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0611/9204/4732/files/DSC06171.jpg?v=1737502172&amp;width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0611/9204/4732/files/DSC06171.jpg?v=1737502172&amp;width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0611/9204/4732/files/DSC06171.jpg?v=1737502172&amp;width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0611/9204/4732/files/DSC06171.jpg?v=1737502172" alt="Man in gym examining a nutritional supplement container." class="r-1ajsi1s" loading="eager"/></picture></div><div data-rid="751742dc-3e83-4375-a3b9-511a6c6ecb79" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0" data-alchemy-url-hashmark="benefits" tabindex="-1" id="benefits" data-alchemy-url-hashmark-ignore="true" class="r-1vcsu79"><picture data-rid="924eb886-3894-4a96-8072-30104e351c8d" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0" class="r-1rnqkn2"><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0611/9204/